  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><h2><strong>• About our brand and products</strong></h2><p class=\"p3\">TriEye designs premium eyewear with an <span class=\"s2\"><strong>integrated rear-view mirror</strong></span>, built to improve safety and awareness without compromising performance or style.</p><p class=\"p3\">Developed in Norway and used globally, our glasses are trusted by cyclists, rowers, triathletes, and commuters who want better visibility in traffic and group rides. The mirror is subtly embedded into the lens, adjustable by the rider, and engineered to stay out of the main field of vision.</p><p class=\"p1\"><br></p><h2><strong>• What makes us different</strong></h2><ul><li><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"><strong>Patented integrated mirror</strong></span> – no add-ons, no distractions</p></li><li><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"><strong>Proven safety benefit</strong></span> – see what’s behind you without turning your head</p></li><li><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"><strong>Performance-first design</strong></span> – lightweight, aerodynamic, and comfortable</p></li><li><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"><strong>Used by real riders</strong></span> – from everyday commuters to competitive athletes</p></li><li><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"><strong>Award-winning innovation</strong></span> – recognized for both function and design</p></li></ul><p class=\"p3\">TriEye solves a real problem in a way no other eyewear brand does.</p><p class=\"p1\"><br></p><h2><strong>• How affiliates can earn</strong></h2><p class=\"p3\">Affiliates earn commission on every sale made through their unique referral link.</p><ul><li><p class=\"p1\">Competitive commission rate per order</p></li><li><p class=\"p1\">Cookie-based tracking ensures you get credit</p></li><li><p class=\"p1\">No cap on earnings</p></li><li><p class=\"p1\">Regular promotions and product launches to boost conversions</p></li></ul><p class=\"p3\">Perfect for creators who value long-term, trust-based recommendations.</p><p class=\"p1\"><br></p><h2><strong>• How to promote us</strong></h2><p class=\"p3\">Affiliates perform best when they show <span class=\"s2\"><strong>real use and real benefits</strong></span>:</p><ul><li><p class=\"p1\">POV riding videos showing the mirror in action</p></li><li><p class=\"p1\">Safety-focused content (traffic, group rides, commuting)</p></li><li><p class=\"p1\">Honest reviews and first impressions</p></li><li><p class=\"p1\">Tutorials: how the mirror works and how to adjust it</p></li><li><p class=\"p1\">Social posts, blogs, YouTube, newsletters, and short-form video</p></li></ul><p class=\"p3\">We encourage authentic storytelling over scripted ads.</p><p class=\"p1\"><br></p><h2><strong>• Other information</strong></h2><ul><li><p class=\"p1\">Worldwide shipping available</p></li><li><p class=\"p1\">Dedicated affiliate support</p></li><li><p class=\"p1\">Access to brand assets and guidance</p></li><li><p class=\"p1\">Transparent tracking and reporting</p></li><li><p class=\"p1\">Brand-safe usage required (no misleading claims or copied content)</p></li></ul><p class=\"p3\">TriEye is built on trust, performance, and rider safety — and we expect our affiliates to represent the brand with the same integrity.</p></div></div>",
